--- B. ADAPT TIMING CLARIFICATION (microseconds, mean +/- SD) ---
   Adapt checked total        72.172 +/-  0.059   (PROTOCOL: las_adapt above, incl. internal PreVerify)
   witness-add only            2.466 +/-  0.008   (DIAGNOSTIC ONLY: z=z_hat+r'; not a protocol op)
